    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the doctor but they're super hard to get a hold of and i can't wait weeks for an appointment when my legs are hurting this bad. it's just a small dose of 99mg, right? that shouldn't be enough to cause a real problem if i'm just trying to fix the deficiency. wouldn't a little extra be fine just to get the cramps to stop?",
