    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what ur saying about the risks but it feels like i'm stuck. i feel so weak and the cramps are making it hard to sleep. if i just take one of those 99mg tablets tonight just to see if it helps, what's the worst that could happen? like, is it really going to be life-threatening if i just try a tiny bit to help the symptoms? i'm not looking to do anything crazy, just something to help me get through the night.",
